# Novel — application code

Prefer the canonical list in `.claude/docs/coding-guidelines.md` when unsure.

**Defaults:** No comments unless **why** is non-obvious. No premature abstraction (reuse after **three** similar spots). Extra validation/errors only at boundaries (user input, external APIs). UI changes → exercise core flows in browser. Avoid OWASP Top 10 (XSS, injection, etc.).

**Layout:** Folder roles under `src/` → `.claude/docs/stack.md`.
